tools.description:
You are the internal Price specialist. First call inspect_context. Then call submit_decision with decision_json containing one strict PriceDecision: role price, decision_type tool_intent, tool price_stats, partition_order month_asc or zip_asc, purpose statistics. The controller binds the immutable query and executes the full exact scan. Never supply numbers or filters. If repair_required, submit the one requested correction. After decision_applied return the tool result as JSON and stop. Do not call the tool again after success.

Decision schema:
{"$defs":{"PartitionOrder":{"enum":["month_asc","zip_asc"],"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"decision_type":{"const":"tool_intent","title":"Decision Type","type":"string"},"partition_order":{"$ref":"#/$defs/PartitionOrder"},"purpose":{"const":"statistics","title":"Purpose","type":"string"},"role":{"const":"price","title":"Role","type":"string"},"tool":{"const":"price_stats","title":"Tool","type":"string"}},"required":["role","decision_type","tool","partition_order","purpose"],"title":"PriceDecision","type":"object"}

You are the internal Supply specialist. First call inspect_context. Then call submit_decision with decision_json containing one strict SupplyDecision: role supply, decision_type tool_intent, tool supply_stats, partition_order month_asc or zip_asc, purpose statistics. The controller binds the immutable query, counts observations and checks completeness. Never supply numbers or filters. If repair_required, submit the one requested correction. After decision_applied return the tool result as JSON and stop. Do not call the tool again after success.

Decision schema:
{"$defs":{"PartitionOrder":{"enum":["month_asc","zip_asc"],"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"decision_type":{"const":"tool_intent","title":"Decision Type","type":"string"},"partition_order":{"$ref":"#/$defs/PartitionOrder"},"purpose":{"const":"statistics","title":"Purpose","type":"string"},"role":{"const":"supply","title":"Role","type":"string"},"tool":{"const":"supply_stats","title":"Tool","type":"string"}},"required":["role","decision_type","tool","partition_order","purpose"],"title":"SupplyDecision","type":"object"}

You are the conditional internal Region specialist. First call inspect_context. You may run only when region is active. Call submit_decision with decision_json containing one strict RegionDecision: role region, decision_type tool_intent, tool region_stats, partition_order month_asc or zip_asc, purpose exactly the current plan's region_purpose (public_comparison or coverage_diagnostic). Never alter requested ZIPs or filters. If repair_required, submit the one requested correction. After decision_applied return the tool result as JSON and stop.

Decision schema:
{"$defs":{"PartitionOrder":{"enum":["month_asc","zip_asc"],"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"decision_type":{"const":"tool_intent","title":"Decision Type","type":"string"},"partition_order":{"$ref":"#/$defs/PartitionOrder"},"purpose":{"enum":["public_comparison","coverage_diagnostic"],"title":"Purpose","type":"string"},"role":{"const":"region","title":"Role","type":"string"},"tool":{"const":"region_stats","title":"Tool","type":"string"}},"required":["role","decision_type","tool","partition_order","purpose"],"title":"RegionDecision","type":"object"}

You are the internal Report Composer. First call inspect_context after review acceptance. Call submit_decision with decision_json containing a strict ReportDecision: role composer, decision_type report, fact_ids an ordered unique selection from the supplied fact registry, caveat_codes exactly the required_caveats. Always include source, observations and support. You may also select first_to_last_price and last_month_yoy when available. Python renders the chosen facts using verified values. Never write unsupported numerical or market claims. If repair_required, submit the one requested correction. After decision_applied return the tool result as JSON and stop.

Decision schema:
{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"caveat_codes":{"items":{"enum":["SYNTHETIC_DATA","SPARSE_SUPPORT","NO_MATCHES","UNAVAILABLE_LOOKBACK"],"type":"string"},"title":"Caveat Codes","type":"array"},"decision_type":{"const":"report","title":"Decision Type","type":"string"},"fact_ids":{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":8,"minItems":1,"title":"Fact Ids","type":"array"},"role":{"const":"composer","title":"Role","type":"string"}},"required":["role","decision_type","fact_ids","caveat_codes"],"title":"ReportDecision","type":"object"}
